Note on redistributed binaries:
The release ZIP archive distributed via the GitHub Releases page of this
repository contains compiled binaries built from third-party sources. Those
binaries are not covered by this license but by their own respective licenses:

- ggml-hip.dll — built from https://github.com/ollama/ollama (MIT License)
- rocblas.dll, rocblas/library/* — from https://github.com/ROCm/rocBLAS (MIT)
- libhipblas.dll — from https://github.com/ROCm/hipBLAS (MIT)
- libhipblaslt.dll — from https://github.com/ROCm/hipBLASLt (MIT)

amdhip64_7.dll is part of AMD's proprietary HIP runtime and is NOT
redistributed through this repository. It is obtained from the user's local
HIP SDK 7.1 installation at deploy time.
